<title>KYRGYZSTAN: TABLE-Kyrgyz GDP in Jan-July rises 14.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kyrgyz GDP in Jan-July rises 14.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product (GDP) in the first seven months of this year was 14.0 percent higher than in the same period last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-July '97  Jan-July '96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	+14.0	   +0.9</p>
